# Data Retention Policy

**{{organizationName}}**  
**Effective Date:** {{effectiveDate}}  
**Version:** {{policyVersion}}  
**Policy Owner:** {{policyOwner}}

---

## 1. Purpose

This policy establishes the data retention periods and secure disposal procedures for all personal data processed by **{{organizationName}}**, in compliance with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 ("DPDP Act") — specifically Sections 4(1)(e) and 8(7) which require data to be retained only as long as necessary for the stated purpose.

---

## 2. Scope

This policy applies to all personal data collected, processed, or stored by {{organizationName}}, its employees, contractors, and third-party processors acting on our behalf.

---

